---
import AnthemPanel from '../components/AnthemPanel.astro';
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { withBase } from '../lib/paths';

const CEREMONY_URL =
  'https://www.canada.ca/en/immigration-refugees-citizenship/services/canadian-citizenship/become-canadian-citizen/citizenship-ceremony.html';
const CEREMONY_URL_FR =
  'https://www.canada.ca/fr/immigration-refugies-citoyennete/services/citoyennete-canadienne/devenir-citoyen-canadien/ceremonie-citoyennete.html';
const rightsHref = `${withBase('/chapters/')}rights-and-responsibilities/`;
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Citizenship ceremony"
  description="Practise the oath of citizenship, recap rights and responsibilities, and review O Canada before the ceremony."
  titleFr="Cérémonie de citoyenneté"
  descriptionFr="Pratiquez le serment de citoyenneté, révisez les droits et devoirs, et relisez Ô Canada avant la cérémonie."
  contextFr="Cérémonie"
>
  <article class="panel">
    <p class="eyebrow" data-i18n="nav.ceremony">Ceremony</p>
    <h1 data-i18n="ceremony.title">Citizenship ceremony</h1>
    <p class="lede" data-i18n="ceremony.lede">
      The test is not the last step. At the ceremony you take the oath, you are already expected to know the rights and responsibilities of citizenship, and O Canada is sung.
    </p>

    <section class="card" aria-labelledby="oath-heading">
      <div class="card-head">
        <h2 id="oath-heading" data-i18n="ceremony.oathTitle">The oath of citizenship</h2>
        <p data-i18n="ceremony.oathLede">
          You may swear or solemnly affirm. The wording is official; this page quotes it so you can practise saying it out loud.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="oath lang-en" x-data="speech">
        <p>
          I swear (or solemnly affirm) that I will be faithful and bear true allegiance to His Majesty
          King Charles the Third, King of Canada, His Heirs and Successors, and that I will faithfully
          observe the laws of Canada, including the Constitution, which recognizes and affirms the
          Aboriginal and treaty rights of First Nations, Inuit and Métis peoples, and fulfil my duties
          as a Canadian citizen.
        </p>
        <p class="button-row">
          <button
            class="button"
            type="button"
            data-i18n="ceremony.swear"
            @click="speak('I swear that I will be faithful and bear true allegiance to His Majesty King Charles the Third, King of Canada, His Heirs and Successors, and that I will faithfully observe the laws of Canada, including the Constitution, which recognizes and affirms the Aboriginal and treaty rights of First Nations, Inuit and Métis peoples, and fulfil my duties as a Canadian citizen.')"
          >
            I swear
          </button>
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="oath lang-fr" x-data="speech">
        <p>
          Je jure (ou j’affirme solennellement) que je serai fidèle et porterai sincère allégeance à Sa
          Majesté le roi Charles Trois, Roi du Canada, à ses héritiers et successeurs, que j’observerai
          fidèlement les lois du Canada, y compris la Constitution, qui reconnaît et confirme les droits
          — ancestraux ou issus de traités — des peuples des Premières Nations, des Inuits et des Métis,
          et que je remplirai loyalement mes obligations de citoyen canadien.
        </p>
        <p class="button-row">
          <button
            class="button"
            type="button"
            data-i18n="ceremony.affirm"
            @click="speak('Je jure que je serai fidèle et porterai sincère allégeance à Sa Majesté le roi Charles Trois, Roi du Canada, à ses héritiers et successeurs, que j’observerai fidèlement les lois du Canada, y compris la Constitution, qui reconnaît et confirme les droits ancestraux ou issus de traités des peuples des Premières Nations, des Inuits et des Métis, et que je remplirai loyalement mes obligations de citoyen canadien.')"
          >
            J’affirme
          </button>
        </p>
      </div>
      <p class="button-row">
        <a class="button lang-en" href={CEREMONY_URL} data-i18n="ceremony.source">
          Read the official ceremony page on Canada.ca
        </a>
        <a class="button lang-fr" href={CEREMONY_URL_FR} data-i18n="ceremony.source">
          Lire la page officielle de la cérémonie sur Canada.ca
        </a>
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="card" style="margin-top:1rem" aria-labelledby="rights-recap">
      <div class="card-head">
        <h2 id="rights-recap" data-i18n="ceremony.rightsTitle">Rights and responsibilities, recap</h2>
        <p data-i18n="ceremony.rightsLede">
          The oath is a promise to observe the laws and fulfil your duties. The first chapter is the fuller list.
        </p>
      </div>
      <ul class="breakdown lang-en">
        <li><strong>Obey the law</strong><span>Including the Constitution and the Charter.</span></li>
        <li><strong>Vote</strong><span>Citizens 18 and over may vote in federal elections.</span></li>
        <li><strong>Jury duty</strong><span>Serve if you are summoned.</span></li>
        <li><strong>Help in the community</strong><span>And protect Canada’s heritage and environment.</span></li>
      </ul>
      <ul class="breakdown lang-fr">
        <li><strong>Respecter la loi</strong><span>Y compris la Constitution et la Charte.</span></li>
        <li><strong>Voter</strong><span>Les citoyens de 18 ans et plus peuvent voter aux élections fédérales.</span></li>
        <li><strong>Jury</strong><span>Servir si vous êtes convoqué.</span></li>
        <li><strong>Aider dans la collectivité</strong><span>Et protéger le patrimoine et l’environnement du Canada.</span></li>
      </ul>
      <p class="button-row">
        <a class="button" href={rightsHref} data-i18n="ceremony.openChapter">Open the chapter</a>
      </p>
    </section>

    <AnthemPanel />
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
